  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting sustainability in Chinese fisheries in the Yellow Sea &amp; SWIO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to address overfishing and Illegal, Unreported and Unregulated activities by Chinese vessels to address marine habitat and food security conditions in the Yellow Sea Ecoregion and the South West Indian Ocean, by:
&#x2022; Improving governance &#x2013; reform of Chinese fisheries policy and legislation.
&#x2022; Leveraging financial instruments to drive sustainable investment - Blue Economy.
&#x2022; Developing market drivers &#x2013; seafood traceability and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
